      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِتْرٌ</span></b>  <i>An error in speech.</i> (S, A, Mgh, Msb,
K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَآءَ بِهِتْرٍ مِنَ القَوْلِ</span> <i>He uttered</i>

<i>an error of speech.</i> (A.) And ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِتْرٌ هَاتِرٌ</span></b>  <i>A
great error of speech.</i> (S, K. *) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A falsehood;
a lie.</i> (K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَوْلٌ هِتْرٌ</span> <i>A false saying</i>
